{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Store a whole "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" on disk and load it again with the same entities, components and entity identifiers."}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/GettingStartedWithFirebladeECS","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentMacro","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEvent","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventDelegate"],"anchor":"Essentials","generated":true,"title":"Essentials"}],"kind":"article","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/SavingAndLoadingScenes"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A nexus encodes as a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusSnapshot"},{"type":"text","text":": every entity with its original identifier, the components conforming to "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/SerializableComponent"},{"type":"text","text":", and the state of the entity identifier generator."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The snapshot works with any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Codable"},{"type":"text","text":" format, such as JSON, property lists or YAML."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Make components serializable","anchor":"Make-components-serializable","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Conform each component you want to persist to "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/SerializableComponent"},{"type":"text","text":", or annotate it with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Component"},{"type":"text","text":" (see "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentMacro"},{"type":"text","text":")."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Give each persisted type an explicit, stable name. The default name is the fully qualified Swift type name, which changes when you rename the type or its module:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["final class Position: SerializableComponent {","    static let componentTypeName = \"Position\"","    var x: Double","    var y: Double","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you rename a type later, list its former names, so existing scene files keep loading:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["final class Health: SerializableComponent {","    static let componentTypeName = \"Health\"","    static let componentTypeNameAliases = [\"HitPoints\"]","    var value: Int","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Components referencing other entities can store an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Entity"},{"type":"text","text":" or an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/EntityIdentifier"},{"type":"text","text":". Both are restored correctly."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Save and load a nexus with Codable","anchor":"Save-and-load-a-nexus-with-Codable","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Codable"},{"type":"text","text":", so it can be part of your own scene type:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["struct Scene: Codable {","    var name: String","    var nexus: Nexus","}","","let data = try JSONEncoder().encode(Scene(name: \"Level 1\", nexus: nexus))","","let decoder = JSONDecoder()","decoder.userInfo[.nexusComponentTypes] = [Position.self, Health.self, Parent.self] as [any SerializableComponent.Type]","decoder.userInfo[.nexusEntityResolver] = EntityReferenceResolver(mapping: [:]) \/\/ needed for `Entity` properties","let scene = try decoder.decode(Scene.self, from: data)"]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Encoding throws ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentSerializationError\/notSerializable(typeName:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" for components that are not serializable.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"To leave runtime-only components out instead, set ","type":"text"},{"code":"encoder.userInfo[.nexusNonSerializableComponentHandling]","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NonSerializableComponentHandling\/skip","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Decoding needs all component types of the scene in ","type":"text"},{"code":"userInfo[.nexusComponentTypes]","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Unknown names throw ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentRegistryError\/unknownTypeName(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The decoded nexus has the same entity identifiers and creates new entities with the identifiers the original nexus would have used next.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Load into an existing nexus","anchor":"Load-into-an-existing-nexus","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To keep a configured nexus, for example one with a delegate, families or a custom generator, use the snapshot API directly:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["var encoder = JSONEncoder()","let data = try nexus.encodeSnapshot(using: &encoder, handling: .throwError)","","let restored = Nexus()","try restored.register([Position.self, Health.self, Parent.self])","var decoder = JSONDecoder()","try restored.restoreSnapshot(from: data, using: &decoder)"]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus\/restoreSnapshot(from:using:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" keeps the entity identifiers. It requires a nexus without entities and emits the usual entity and component events.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus\/decodeSnapshot(from:using:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" adds the snapshot as new entities to a populated nexus, for example for prefabs, and returns the mapping from saved to new identifiers.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Both roll back all changes if decoding fails."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Use other formats","anchor":"Use-other-formats","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The snapshot API accepts any coder conforming to "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/TopLevelEncoder"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/TopLevelDecoder"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"JSONEncoder"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PropertyListEncoder"},{"type":"text","text":" and their decoders conform out of the box."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For other formats, add the conformance in your project. For example, with "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/jpsim\/Yams"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Yams","","struct YAMLSceneEncoder: TopLevelEncoder {","    var userInfo: [CodingUserInfoKey: UserInfoValue] = [:]","    func encode<T: Encodable>(_ value: T) throws -> String {","        try YAMLEncoder().encode(value, userInfo: userInfo)","    }","}","","struct YAMLSceneDecoder: TopLevelDecoder {","    var userInfo: [CodingUserInfoKey: UserInfoValue] = [:]","    func decode<T: Decodable>(_ type: T.Type, from yaml: String) throws -> T {","        try YAMLDecoder().decode(type, from: yaml, userInfo: userInfo)","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Nexus: Codable"},{"text":" works with any ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Codable"},{"text":" coder directly.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For deterministic output, for example for scene files under version control, sort the keys, e.g. with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"JSONEncoder.OutputFormatting.sortedKeys"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"What a snapshot contains","anchor":"What-a-snapshot-contains","level":3},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every entity, including entities without components, with its original identifier."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every serializable component. A component instance shared by several entities is stored once and shared again after loading."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The entity identifier generator state, if the generator conforms to "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/PersistableEntityIdentifierGenerator"},{"type":"text","text":". "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/LinearIncrementingEntityIdGenerator"},{"type":"text","text":" does."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Not contained are components that are not serializable, families (they are derived from the components) and the nexus delegate.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The format is versioned by ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusSnapshot\/formatVersion","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":". Newer versions of FirebladeECS keep loading older snapshots and reject snapshots written by a newer version.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/savingandloadingscenes"]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"FirebladeECS"}],"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"Saving and Loading Scenes"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/PersistableEntityIdentifierGenerator":{"abstract":[{"text":"An entity identifier generator whose state can be saved in a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusSnapshot","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PersistableEntityIdentifierGenerator"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/persistableentityidentifiergenerator","title":"PersistableEntityIdentifierGenerator","role":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PersistableEntityIdentifierGenerator"}],"identifier":"doc:\/